abstract: >-
  Analysis code, protocol documents and summary-level results for a human-genetic study of the LDL/ApoB and lipoprotein(a)
  axes of coronary artery disease in UK Biobank, including a genetic comparison with the Lp(a)HORIZON trial and conditional
  forecasts for two ongoing trials. No individual-level data are included.
